.TH "TODOPRO SCRATCHPAD UPDATE" "1" "2026-10-13" "1.0.0" "todopro scratchpad update Manual"
.SH NAME
todopro\-scratchpad\-update \- Update a scratchpad's title and/or content.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B todopro scratchpad update
[OPTIONS] SCRATCHPAD_ID
.SH DESCRIPTION
Update a scratchpad's title and/or content.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-t,\fP \-\-title TEXT
New title
.TP
\fB\-c,\fP \-\-content TEXT
New note body (HTML/plaintext)
.TP
\fB\-f,\fP \-\-content\-file TEXT
Read new note body from a file
.TP
\fB\-o,\fP \-\-output TEXT
Output format  [default: table]
